#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"You can use options to customize the Executor primitive.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Tu peux utiliser des options pour personnaliser la primitive Executor.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can see the available options and update option values during or after "
"primitive initialization.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu peux voir les options disponibles et mettre à jour les valeurs des "
"options pendant ou après l'initialisation de la primitive.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use the `update()` method to apply changes to the `options` attribute.\n"
msgstr ""
"Utilise la méthode `update()` pour appliquer des modifications à l'attribut "
"`options`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- The `options` attribute is the `dataclass` Python type.  You can use the built-in `asdict` method to convert it to a dictionary.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"- L'attribut `options` est le type Python `dataclass`. Tu peux utiliser la méthode intégrée `asdict` pour le convertir en dictionnaire.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"pass-options\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"pass-options\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set Executor options {#set-executor-options}"
msgstr "Définir les options Executor {#set-executor-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If an option is specified both during and after primitive initialization, "
"the value set after initializing the primitive is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si une option est spécifiée à la fois pendant et après l'initialisation de "
"la primitive, la valeur définie après l'initialisation de la primitive est "
"utilisée.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Primitive initialization {#primitive-initialization}"
msgstr "Initialisation de la primitive {#primitive-initialization}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can pass in an instance of the options class or a dictionary when "
"initializing Executor, which then makes a copy of those options. Thus, "
"changing the original dictionary or options instance doesn't affect the "
"options owned by the primitive.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu peux passer une instance de la classe d'options ou un dictionnaire lors "
"de l'initialisation d'Executor, qui fait ensuite une copie de ces options. "
"Ainsi, la modification du dictionnaire original ou de l'instance d'options "
"n'affecte pas les options appartenant à la primitive.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Options class {#options-class}"
msgstr "Classe d'options {#options-class}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When creating an instance of the `Executor` class, you can pass in an "
"instance of the options class. Those options are then applied when you use "
"`run()` to perform the calculation.  Specify the options in this format:  "
"`options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice`.  For example: "
"`options.environment.log_level = INFO`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lors de la création d'une instance de la classe `Executor`, tu peux passer "
"une instance de la classe d'options. Ces options sont ensuite appliquées "
"lorsque tu utilises `run()` pour effectuer le calcul. Spécifie les options "
"dans ce format : `options.option.sous-option.sous-sous-option = choix`. Par "
"exemple : `options.environment.log_level = INFO`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Exemple :\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Dictionary {#dictionary}"
msgstr "Dictionnaire {#dictionary}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can specify options as a dictionary when initializing Executor.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu peux spécifier les options sous forme de dictionnaire lors de "
"l'initialisation d'Executor.\n"

